# MetaHuman players (docs/decisions/0006-metahuman-players.md): each one is hundreds of MB to
# GBs of binary content under the MetaHuman licence, so they stay on the machine that made
# them. Data/PlayerBodies.json names them; a clone without them shows the placeholders.
/Content/MetaHumans/
/Content/Padel/Characters/MetaHumans/
# Epic's UE5 mannequin, copied from the engine's Third Person template by
